==================== 5. Deleting from a destination ====================

$ rclone deletefile data/site-a/extra-at-destination.txt -v        # one file
2026/11/01 16:47:46 INFO  : extra-at-destination.txt: Deleted

$ rclone delete data/site-a --include '*.txt' --dry-run            # filter preview
2026/11/01 16:47:46 NOTICE: processed/upload-1.txt: Skipped delete as --dry-run is set (size 16)
2026/11/01 16:47:46 NOTICE: processed/2026/upload-3.txt: Skipped delete as --dry-run is set (size 12)
2026/11/01 16:47:46 NOTICE: docs/notes/2026/todo.txt: Skipped delete as --dry-run is set (size 38)
2026/11/01 16:47:46 NOTICE: processed/2026/upload-2.txt: Skipped delete as --dry-run is set (size 15)
