==================== 6. check: are two locations identical? ====================

$ rclone check data/source data/site-b                      # compares sizes + hashes (MD5/SHA1 for local)
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Local file system at data/site-b: 0 differences found
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Local file system at data/site-b: 6 matching files
# corrupt a file WITHOUT changing its size or modtime (like silent bit rot or a bad disk)

$ printf '%-37s\n' 'TAMPERED' > data/site-b/docs/notes/2026/todo.txt   # same 38 bytes

$ touch -r data/source/docs/notes/2026/todo.txt data/site-b/docs/notes/2026/todo.txt   # same modtime, different content

$ rclone check data/source data/site-b
2026/11/01 16:47:47 ERROR : docs/notes/2026/todo.txt: md5 differ
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Local file system at data/site-b: 1 differences found
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Local file system at data/site-b: 1 errors while checking
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Local file system at data/site-b: 5 matching files
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: Failed to check: 1 differences found
(exit code 1)
# copy compares size+modtime by default, so it MISSES this change:

$ rclone copy data/source data/site-b -v --dry-run
2026/11/01 16:47:47 INFO  : There was nothing to transfer
2026/11/01 16:47:47 NOTICE: 
Transferred:   	          0 B / 0 B, -, 0 B/s, ETA -
Checks:                 6 / 6, 100%, Listed 24
Elapsed time:         0.0s

# --checksum compares hashes instead and catches it

$ rclone copy data/source data/site-b -v --checksum
2026/11/01 16:47:48 INFO  : docs/notes/2026/todo.txt: Copied (replaced existing)
2026/11/01 16:47:48 INFO  : docs/notes/2026: Set directory modification time (using SetModTime)
2026/11/01 16:47:48 INFO  : docs/notes: Set directory modification time (using SetModTime)
2026/11/01 16:47:48 INFO  : docs: Set directory modification time (using SetModTime)
2026/11/01 16:47:48 INFO  : 
Transferred:   	         38 B / 38 B, 100%, 0 B/s, ETA -
Checks:                 6 / 6, 100%, Listed 24
Transferred:            1 / 1, 100%
Elapsed time:         0.1s


$ rclone check data/source data/site-b --combined -   # per-file report: = same, * differ, + only in src, - only in dst
= pdfs/invoice-001.pdf
= pdfs/reports/q3-report.pdf
= docs/notes/2026/todo.txt
= docs/readme.txt
= docs/notes/2026/meeting-notes.txt
= videos/lecture-100MB.bin
